    text: "Oh my poor baby... I\u2019ve been looking everywhere\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Baby Dolphin
    text: "I couldn\u2019t hear you\u2026Everything was too loud\u2026Then nothing..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: "Shh\u2026 it\u2019s alright now. You\u2019re safe. Mommy's here."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: "\u2026The noise again. It\u2019s getting worse."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Seahorse
    text: "Oh, my, Ocean! You are Dorothy! I\u2019ve heard you before\u2026Your songs\u2026they
      travel across the whole reef."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Seahorse
    text: "If anyone can reach others\u2026it\u2019s you."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: Oh hi little Sea Horse, you brought my child back...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "I\u2019m gathering a melody\u2026to call for help."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: "\u2026The old melody."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: I remember it.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: "If voices still matter\u2026we should try."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: (A clear, resonant note spreads through the water.)
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a479e6bd0a099f64a89be595a1e4652a, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: "This is my note. It carries far\u2026 when the waters allow it."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: But a melody needs more than one voice.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Dorothy The Dolphin
    text: "We\u2019ll come with you."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Baby Dolphin
    text: "I\u2019ll stay close this time."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
